{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794669318390,"sessionID":"ses_e255ff46fffexTncZnylD3HfiJ","part":{"id":"prt_1daa090f5001mjdj4d0JZpWeCa","sessionID":"ses_e255ff46fffexTncZnylD3HfiJ","messageID":"msg_1daa085ae001El2bVI28B22OKM","type":"step-start","snapshot":"71e95b668e650a4d2bf68d7fa19ec0e2269f5107"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794669318820,"sessionID":"ses_e255ff46fffexTncZnylD3HfiJ","part":{"partID":"prt_1daa09269001YnQZmJrtnLiHq8","sessionID":"ses_e255ff46fffexTncZnylD3HfiJ","messageID":"msg_1daa085ae001El2bVI28B22OKM","type":"tool","id":"call_01_5riaxh6frtjfmhl5o44hud0u","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n \"steer.md\\|iterations\\|phase_synthesis\\|phase_main_loop\\|step_create_state_log\\|step_reduce_state\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-auto.yaml | sed -n '1,80p'"},"output":"36:  max_iterations: 7\n39:  stop_policy: \"[convergence|max-iterations] - Stop behavior. Default: convergence. max-iterations treats convergence as telemetry until the hard iteration ceiling.\"\n141:  iteration_dir: \"{artifact_dir}/iterations\"\n142:  iteration_pattern: \"{artifact_dir}/iterations/iteration-{NNN}.md\"\n218:      deep-review agent is used only for individual iterations, never as a full-loop\n220:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n221:      phase_main_loop entirely (those are the single-executor path). The merge step in\n222:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n252:          - required_values_present: [review_target, review_target_type, review_dimensions, spec_folder, lineage_mode, max_iterations, convergence_threshold, convergence_mode, stop_policy]\n274:        action: \"Rehome legacy review artifacts into review/iterations before session classification\"\n389:          open_run: \"Run step_create_state_log.command unchanged. With the hand-written log set aside, it opens the run from the moved config.\"\n420:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n464:          2. Subsequent iterations follow risk-ordered deep passes:\n529:          maxIterations: \"{max_iterations}\"\n547:      step_create_state_log:\n618:          max_iterations: \"{max_iterations}\"\n661:    purpose: Dispatch review agent iterations until convergence\n663:    max_repeats: \"{max_iterations}\"\n697:          - p0_count: \"Count P0 findings across all iterations\"\n698:          - p1_count: \"Count P1 findings across all iterations\"\n699:          - p2_count: \"Count P2 findings across all iterations\"\n711:          - stop_policy: \"Extract stopPolicy from deep-review-config.json, default 'convergence'. Valid values: convergence, max-iterations.\"\n714:          - pivot_lineage: \"Summarize registry.divergence.completed and registry.divergence.overrides with pivot ids, source iterations, and selected review direction; else 'none yet'\"\n782:             a) if iteration_count >= max_iterations: set decision = \"STOP\", stopReason = \"maxIterationsReached\", hard_stop_reason = \"max_iterations_reached\", preserve any failed legal-stop gates as terminal evidence, and proceed to synthesis without legal-stop veto\n783:             b) if stop_policy == \"max-iterations\" AND iteration_count < max_iterations: do not allow all-dimensions-clean or composite convergence to stop; treat convergence signals as telemetry, set decision = \"CONTINUE\", and broaden the next review angle.\n794:               a) Rolling average (w=0.30, window=2, needs 2+ iterations):\n797:               b) MAD noise floor (w=0.25, needs 3+ iterations):\n805:               if stop_policy == \"max-iterations\" AND iteration_count < max_iterations: convergence votes are telemetry only; set weighted_stop_score for diagnostics, keep decision = \"CONTINUE\", and choose a broader next focus.\n942:                    maxIterations: Number('{max_iterations}'),\n1105:                  skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1108:              skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1111:            skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1125:            pending_stop_detail: \"Recovery path activated after repeated no-progress iterations\"\n1155:          Iteration: {current_iteration} of {max_iterations}\n1195:            Iteration: {current_iteration} of {max_iterations}\n1212:              max_iterations: \"{max_iterations}\"\n2016:            escalation: \"After 3 consecutive failures across iterations, trigger stuck_recovery event with diagnostic context\"\n2074:          - typed_packets_present: \"Every new P0/P1 finding in review/iterations/iteration-{NNN}.md contains a claim-adjudication JSON block\"\n2165:          - Iteration: {current_iteration} of {max_iterations}\n2222:  phase_synthesis:\n2253:          - p0_count: \"Total P0 findings across all iterations (deduped)\"\n2254:          - p1_count: \"Total P1 findings across all iterations (deduped)\"\n2255:          - p2_count: \"Total P2 findings across all iterations (deduped)\"\n2286:      step_read_all_iterations:\n2292:        action: \"Build deduplicated finding registry from all iterations\"\n2310:             - Findings marked contested across iterations → referee pass\n2461:        note: \"Staging the whole artifact_dir keeps the iteration trail (iterations/, deltas/, state.jsonl, strategy, findings-registry, and the report) together; the operator keeps commit authority and can `git restore --staged {path}` before committing. Failure is non-fatal -- log warning and continue.\"\n2514:        - review/review-report.md (compiled from {iteration_count} iterations)\n2515:        - {iteration_count} iteration files in review/iterations/\n2545:    - respect_max_iterations_cap\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"36:  max_iterations: 7\n39:  stop_policy: \"[convergence|max-iterations] - Stop behavior. Default: convergence. max-iterations treats convergence as telemetry until the hard iteration ceiling.\"\n141:  iteration_dir: \"{artifact_dir}/iterations\"\n142:  iteration_pattern: \"{artifact_dir}/iterations/iteration-{NNN}.md\"\n218:      deep-review agent is used only for individual iterations, never as a full-loop\n220:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n221:      phase_main_loop entirely (those are the single-executor path). The merge step in\n222:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n252:          - required_values_present: [review_target, review_target_type, review_dimensions, spec_folder, lineage_mode, max_iterations, convergence_threshold, convergence_mode, stop_policy]\n274:        action: \"Rehome legacy review artifacts into review/iterations before session classification\"\n389:          open_run: \"Run step_create_state_log.command unchanged. With the hand-written log set aside, it opens the run from the moved config.\"\n420:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n464:          2. Subsequent iterations follow risk-ordered deep passes:\n529:          maxIterations: \"{max_iterations}\"\n547:      step_create_state_log:\n618:          max_iterations: \"{max_iterations}\"\n661:    purpose: Dispatch review agent iterations until convergence\n663:    max_repeats: \"{max_iterations}\"\n697:          - p0_count: \"Count P0 findings across all iterations\"\n698:          - p1_count: \"Count P1 findings across all iterations\"\n699:          - p2_count: \"Count P2 findings across all iterations\"\n711:          - stop_policy: \"Extract stopPolicy from deep-review-config.json, default 'convergence'. Valid values: convergence, max-iterations.\"\n714:          - pivot_lineage: \"Summarize registry.divergence.completed and registry.divergence.overrides with pivot ids, source iterations, and selected review direction; else 'none yet'\"\n782:             a) if iteration_count >= max_iterations: set decision = \"STOP\", stopReason = \"maxIterationsReached\", hard_stop_reason = \"max_iterations_reached\", preserve any failed legal-stop gates as terminal evidence, and proceed to synthesis without legal-stop veto\n783:             b) if stop_policy == \"max-iterations\" AND iteration_count < max_iterations: do not allow all-dimensions-clean or composite convergence to stop; treat convergence signals as telemetry, set decision = \"CONTINUE\", and broaden the next review angle.\n794:               a) Rolling average (w=0.30, window=2, needs 2+ iterations):\n797:               b) MAD noise floor (w=0.25, needs 3+ iterations):\n805:               if stop_policy == \"max-iterations\" AND iteration_count < max_iterations: convergence votes are telemetry only; set weighted_stop_score for diagnostics, keep decision = \"CONTINUE\", and choose a broader next focus.\n942:                    maxIterations: Number('{max_iterations}'),\n1105:                  skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1108:              skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1111:            skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1125:            pending_stop_detail: \"Recovery path activated after repeated no-progress iterations\"\n1155:          Iteration: {current_iteration} of {max_iterations}\n1195:            Iteration: {current_iteration} of {max_iterations}\n1212:              max_iterations: \"{max_iterations}\"\n2016:            escalation: \"After 3 consecutive failures across iterations, trigger stuck_recovery event with diagnostic context\"\n2074:          - typed_packets_present: \"Every new P0/P1 finding in review/iterations/iteration-{NNN}.md contains a claim-adjudication JSON block\"\n2165:          - Iteration: {current_iteration} of {max_iterations}\n2222:  phase_synthesis:\n2253:          - p0_count: \"Total P0 findings across all iterations (deduped)\"\n2254:          - p1_count: \"Total P1 findings across all iterations (deduped)\"\n2255:          - p2_count: \"Total P2 findings across all iterations (deduped)\"\n2286:      step_read_all_iterations:\n2292:        action: \"Build deduplicated finding registry from all iterations\"\n2310:             - Findings marked contested across iterations → referee pass\n2461:        note: \"Staging the whole artifact_dir keeps the iteration trail (iterations/, deltas/, state.jsonl, strategy, findings-registry, and the report) together; the operator keeps commit authority and can `git restore --staged {path}` before committing. Failure is non-fatal -- log warning and continue.\"\n2514:        - review/review-report.md (compiled from {iteration_count} iterations)\n2515:        - {iteration_count} iteration files in review/iterations/\n2545:    - respect_max_iterations_cap\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"grep -n \\\"steer.md\\\\|iterations\\\\|phase_synthesis\\\\|phase_main_loop\\\\|step_create_state_log\\\\|step_reduce_state\\\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-auto.yaml | sed -n '1,80p'\"}"},"time":{"start":1794669318761,"end":1794669318820}}}}
