ration}.md', 'utf8'), repoRoot);\n220:            const dispatchId = 'review-i{current_iteration}-g{generation}';\n230:              iteration: Number('{current_iteration}'),\n240:              iteration: Number('{current_iteration}'),\n267:            - \"cli-pi single-executor: dispatches per-iteration through the shared fan-out command builder (buildLineageCommand) so the enforced cli-pi model allowlist + headless write flags stay one source of truth; runAuditedExecutorCommand emits INTENT + COMPLETION receipts\"\n272:          command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/verify-iteration.cjs --loop-type review --artifact-dir {artifact_dir} --iteration {current_iteration}\"\n273:          command_note: \"Mechanical leaf-reliability gate: exit 0 = complete; non-zero prints one machine reason (dispatch_failed|iteration_file_missing|iteration_verdict_missing|state_record_missing|route_proof_missing|route_proof_mismatch|delta_file_missing). dispatch_failed means the narrative is missing and the completion receipt shows a non-zero exit or a signal. The script enforces the artifact + route-proof contract instead of trusting the leaf to self-report, and a non-zero exit triggers on_failure.redispatch_once.\"\n274:          assert_exists: \"{state_paths.iteration_pattern}\"\n275:          assert_appended: \"{state_paths.state_log}\"\n276:          assert_jsonl_fields: [type, iteration, mode, run, status, focus, dimensions, filesReviewed, findingsCount, findingsSummary, findingsNew, findingDetails, newFindingsRatio, sessionId, generation, lineageMode, timestamp, durationMs]\n284:            dispatchId: \"review-i{current_iteration}-g{generation}\"\n285:          assert_canonical_type: \"iteration\"\n287:          assert_delta_file_has_iteration_record: true\n289:            - iteration_file_missing\n290:            - iteration_file_empty\n291:            - jsonl_not_appended\n297:            - delta_file_missing_iteration_record\n304:            - delta_iteration_id_mismatch\n305:            - state_delta_iteration_mismatch\n312:            event_shape: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"schema_advisory\",\"mode\":\"review\",\"iteration\":{current_iteration},\"warnings\":{result.warnings},\"severity\":\"advisory\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\"}'\n316:            redispatch_once: \"On the FIRST failure of the mechanical command check for this iteration, re-run step_dispatch_iteration exactly once for the same iteration number, then re-run the check. If it still fails, record the iteration as error (per step_evaluate_results.on_missing_outputs) and continue. Never re-dispatch a given iteration more than once.\"\n317:            escalation: \"After 3 consecutive failures across iterations, trigger stuck_recovery event with diagnostic context\"\n329:        action: \"Verify iteration outputs and extract metrics\"\n331:          - file_exists: \"{state_paths.iteration_pattern}\"\n332:          - jsonl_appended: \"New iteration record in state.jsonl\"\n335:          - newFindingsRatio: \"From latest JSONL iteration record\"\n336:          - findings_count: \"From latest JSONL iteration record\"\n337:          - severity_counts: \"From latest JSONL iteration record (P0, P1, P2)\"\n338:          - dimensions: \"From latest JSONL iteration record\"\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"361:          append_jsonl: '{\"stem\":\"deep_review.run_resumed\",\"scope\":{\"runId\":\"{session_id}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"generation\":{generation}},\"data\":{\"priorTailDigest\":\"{prior_tail_digest}\",\"sourceSessionId\":\"{session_id}\",\"resumeReason\":\"Auto-resume: state artifacts are complete and consistent; continue the same lineage.\",\"continuedFromRunId\":\"{session_id}-i{iteration_count}\",\"compatibilityDecision\":\"exact\",\"recoveryReceiptRef\":\"none\"}}'\n602:        append_jsonl: '{\"stem\":\"deep_review.run_restarted\",