s/command-meaning-anchor.vitest.ts` printed `Tests  28 passed (28)` and `rg -c -F 'doctor:sk-skill' scratch/repro-after.txt` printed nothing (`tasks.md:86`) | Met | - |\n    61\t| AC-006 | REQ-006 | Given a no-edit request, When command rows of class `add-only`, `mutates` and `read-only` pass, Then only the `read-only` row still passes | Observed: `npx vitest run tests/command-meaning-anchor.vitest.ts` printed `Tests  28 passed (28)` and the T014 pattern for `/doctor:speckit` and `/doctor:deep-loop` over `scratch/repro-after.txt` printed nothing (`tasks.md:91`) | Met | - |\n    62\t| AC-007 | REQ-007 | Given a weak problem cue and no passing skill, When the ranker scores below 10, Then no doctor command is handed off, and at 10 or more it is | Observed: `npx vitest run tests/scorer/doctor-handoff-command.vitest.ts` printed `Tests  16 passed (16)` and both app-problem prompts print `(no recommendation)` in `scratch/repro-after.txt`. The weak cue has its own bar of 9 (`tasks.md:93`, `tasks.md:95`) | Met | - |\n    63\t| AC-008 | REQ-008 | Given the phase diff, When added comment lines are searched for a spec path or an id, Then nothing is found and only seven files changed | Observed: the comment id search in `scratch/boundaries.txt` exited 1 and the AGENTS.md and package checks printed nothing. Eight files changed, the seven named plus `command-routing-baseline.json`, recaptured under decision P020 in `../decision-record.md` (`tasks.md:110`) | Met | - |\n    64\t| AC-009 | REQ-001 | Given the whole advisor suite, When it runs after the build, Then it reports 0 failed with more passed tests than before | Observed: `scratch/after.txt` holds 1919 passed, 6 skipped and 0 failed over 184 of 184 files, against 1838 passed before (`tasks.md:107`) | Met | - |\n    65\t\n    66\t### Status values\n    44\texport const DOCTOR_HELPER_MIN_SCORE = 6;\n    45\t\n    46\t/** Helper rank score that stands in for a cue when no skill passes. */\n    47\texport const DOCTOR_HELPER_UNCU