d `feature-catalog/scorer-fusion/command-meaning-matching.md` -- plus the phase 020 requirement that fixes the weak-cue bar. - Reason: iteration 1 found the code-level attach gaps; the docs and the phase requirement are the places where the packet's own claims can disagree with the changed code. - Rotation status: correctness and security complete (CONDITIONAL), traceability next. - Blocked/productive carry-forward: security was productive (one P2); no blocked approach. - Required evidence: line-level comparison of each doc claim with the changed code, and the phase 020 `REQ-007` text against `DOCTOR_HELPER_WEAK_CUE_MIN_SCORE`. Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\n231-\n232-<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- The renderer, hooks, plugin, session readers and doctor command docs are the\n  `render-hooks-plugin-4` and `doctor-docs-4` lineages' scope. This lineage reads them only as\n  context evidence.\n- The transcript scorer, command-offer harness, capture baseline and corpus files are the\n  `accuracy-runner-4` lineage's scope. The operator focus asks about their arithmetic; this\n  lineage records the boundary and does not raise code findings outside it.\n- Holdout prompt text is never read or printed. Corpus work is limited to counts and\n  `jq 'del(.prompt)'` rows.\n- No code changes: review is observation-only.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence: `newFindingsRatio` at or below the 0.10 threshold with no active P0.\n- Cap: `maxIterations` 4.\n- Stuck: two consecutive iterations with no new evidence (stuckThreshold 2).\n- Any active P0 blocks PASS regardless of convergence.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n- [x] correctness\n- [x] security\n- [x] traceability\n229:## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n230-- Dimension: traceability - Focus area: the shared docs that describe the changed attach/handler/scorer behaviour -- `feature-catalog/cli-surface/advisor-recommend.md` and `feature-catalog/scorer-fusion/command-meaning-matching.md` -- plus the phase 020 requirement that fixes the weak-cue bar. - Reason: iteration 1 found the code-level attach gaps; the docs and the phase requirement are the places where the packet's own claims can disagree with the changed code. - Rotation status: correctness and security complete (CONDITIONAL), traceability next. - Blocked/productive carry-forward: security was productive (one P2); no blocked approach. - Required evidence: line-level comparison of each doc claim with the changed code, and the phase 020 `REQ-007` text against `DOCTOR_HELPER_WEAK_CUE_MIN_SCORE`. Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\n231-\n232-<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && sed -n '46,75p' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-4/deep-review-strategy.md; grep -n \\\"NEXT FOCUS\\\" -A3 specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-4/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794670625500,"end":1794670625612}}}}
